# GitHub Actions (don't break CI)

- **Real app directory**: The Flutter package checked into Git lives under **`apps/waddle_display/`** (underscore). **`apps/waddle-display`** and **`apps/waddle_view`** are not the tracked path, `defaults.run.working-directory`, `run: cd ...`, artifact paths, and **`on.*.paths`** must match **`apps/waddle_display`** (Linux runners are case-sensitive).
- **Verify before commit**: After editing a workflow, grep it for `apps/waddle` and confirm every reference is **`waddle_display`**. If the app is ever renamed in Git, update **all** workflows and **`pull_request` / `push` path filters** in the same change.
- **Path filters**: `on.pull_request.paths` entries that don't match real folders mean CI **never runs** for those PRs, keep them aligned with the tree (e.g. `'apps/waddle_display/**'`, `'apps/waddlectl/**'`, `'packages/waddle_shared/**'`, and root `'pubspec.yaml'` for workspace changes).
- **Cross-check**: Docker/deploy docs that mount build output (e.g. Pi image) should use the same **`apps/waddle_display/...`** segment as local **`git ls-files apps/`**.
- **Optional sanity check**: Run a quick YAML parse locally if you use a schema validator; workflow logic errors still need **`gh workflow run`** / a test branch or PR to fully exercise.
- **Release / CI bundles**: Desktop Linux uses **[`release-linux-desktop.yml`](../../.github/workflows/release-linux-desktop.yml)** (`arch: x64` \| `arm64`). Windows uses **[`release-windows-desktop.yml`](../../.github/workflows/release-windows-desktop.yml)** with **`arch: x64` only** from `ci.yml` / `release.yml` for now (arm64 remains implementable in the reusable workflow; do not call it until Flutter Win arm64 is ready). **Pi** stays **[`release-pi.yml`](../../.github/workflows/release-pi.yml)** only (`waddle-view-linux-arm64-*`). Generic ARM64 Linux desktop assets are **`waddle-view-linux-arm64-desktop-*`** / artifact `linux-arm64-desktop-bundle-*` (do not collide with Pi `linux-arm64-bundle-*`). Mobile compile: **`release-android.yml`**, **`release-ios.yml`**, **`release-macos.yml`**. Legacy shims **`release-linux-x64.yml`** / **`release-windows.yml`** delegate to desktop workflows with `arch: x64`.
- **Display CI**: **[`ci.yml`](../../.github/workflows/ci.yml)** workflow name **CI - waddle_display**: Flutter analyze/test, platform compile artifacts, mock API, deploy validation. PR paths: `apps/waddle_display/**`, shared packages, `deploy/**`, etc. (not `apps/waddle_controller/**`).
- **Controller CI**: **[`ci-controller.yml`](../../.github/workflows/ci-controller.yml)** workflow name **CI - waddle_controller**: Vitest, coverage, `build`, `build:server`. PR paths: `apps/waddle_controller/**`, `packages/waddle_node_tls/**`.
- **Controller Docker CI**: **[`ci-controller-docker.yml`](../../.github/workflows/ci-controller-docker.yml)** workflow name **CI - waddle_controller Docker**: builds and uploads `ci-controller-docker-*` artifacts (reuses **[`release-controller-docker.yml`](../../.github/workflows/release-controller-docker.yml)**). Same PR path filters as controller CI plus `release-controller-docker.yml`; push to `main`/`master` runs without path filter on controller workflows.
